{"availability":"available","full":"espmaniac/MeshToZero","name":"MeshToZero","description":"Browser-based tool for centering 3D meshes and point clouds at the world origin, aligning them to axes and planes, and exporting transformed OBJ, PLY, and STL files.","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-07-26T00:09:03Z","updated":"2026-10-17T15:00:03Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://espmaniac.github.io/MeshToZero/","topics":["3d-alignment","center-to-origin","github-pages","mesh-alignment","mesh-to-origin","model-centering","point-cloud-alignment"],"demo":"https://espmaniac.github.io/MeshToZero/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-17T22:39:58.118Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-17T22:39:58.118Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-17T22:39:58.118Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T18:26:10.130Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-11T06:13:24.818Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-12T02:05:23.511Z","stars":1,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-17T22:39:58.118Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A browser-based workspace for centering, orienting, and precisely aligning 3D meshes and point clouds.","MeshToZero provides non-destructive tools for preparing PLY, OBJ, and STL models directly in the browser. Import a model, create geometric reference planes, align it to world axes or the XY bed, and export the transformed geometry in its original format.","The application is built with HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and Three.js. It has no framework dependency, build step, account requirement, or server-side component."],"features":["Center-pivot Move and Rotate gizmos","World and Local coordinate spaces","Position-to-grid and rotation-to-angle snapping","CAD object snaps for vertices, edge midpoints, nearest edge points, faces, centers, and plane intersections","Snap-to-snap translation from a model reference to Grid, a world-plane intersection, or World Origin"],"sourceUr